  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The breath of the wind provides the vitality and force needed for your body to reach greater speeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you are ki focused and not wearing heavy armor or carrying a heavy load, you gain an insight bonus of 5 feet to your speed per point of ki invested in this chakra.</p>\n<p>When you expend your ki focus and are not wearing heavy armor or carrying a heavy load, you gain an insight bonus of 15 feet to your base speed per ki point expended in this chakra for one round.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
